{"id": "34144", "title": "一池春水悄悄乱", "author": "皑银", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34144/34144s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34144.htm", "intro": "魁梧的身躯显得多么结实、动作又是那么矫健优美，他浑身上下简直充满男性的阳刚和力量之美……哎哎哎！她……到底在想些什么！他都说当她是亲妹子般照顾疼爱了，她又怎能有非份之想？就算她是出身豪门巨室的千金小姐又如何？既然沦落为红香院里的清倌花魁，怕是没资格妄想像他这般正直谦和的男子汉……可、可她救了身受重伤的他、他亦救她免于杀身之祸，这难道不是一种命定的缘份？所以——他绝对是她幸福的依靠！她嫁定他啦！不过——她这花魁从没勾引过男人，这会儿……她该从何处下手呢？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34144", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2170984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2170985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2170986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2170987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2170988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2170989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2170990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2170991.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2170992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2170993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2170994.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2170995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2170996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2170997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2170998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2170999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2171000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2171001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2171002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2171003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2171004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2171005.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2171006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2171007.html", "available"